  "description": "Supplying goods and services to the Civil Nuclear Constabulary (CNC).\r\n",
  "details": {
    "body": "\u003Cdiv class=\"govspeak\"\u003E\u003Ch2 id=\"doing-business-with-the-cnc\"\u003EDoing business with the \u003Cabbr title=\"Civil Nuclear Constabulary\"\u003ECNC\u003C/abbr\u003E\n\u003C/h2\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EOur contracts and procurement team prepares tenders, drafts terms and evaluates offers.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EWe may post tender notices through:\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cul\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.blpd.gov.uk/logon.aspx?ReturnUrl=%2fdefault.aspx\"\u003Ethe Bluelight ProContract website\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca rel=\"external\" href=\"http://www.ojec.com/\"\u003Ethe Official Journal of the European Union\u003C/a\u003E, where required by the European Union Procurement Directive\u003C/li\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://www.gov.uk/contracts-finder\"\u003EContracts Finder\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are a number of opportunities coming up as follows\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cul\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003ERadio Equipment for the Site Security Control Rooms\u003C/li\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003EEmployee Assistance Programme\u003C/li\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003EMOE Shotguns\u003C/li\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003ESurvey Software\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you’re interested in either of these procurement opportunities send an email to \u003Ca href=\"mailto:procurement@cnc.pnn.police.uk\"\u003Eprocurement@cnc.pnn.police.uk\u003C/a\u003E with the specific procurement opportunity referenced in the subject line.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Ch2 id=\"standard-supplier-terms-and-conditions\"\u003EStandard supplier terms and conditions\u003C/h2\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EPurchases we make are subject to our terms and conditions, but some purchases may be subject to a special set of terms and conditions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Csection data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\"\u003E\n  \u003Cdiv class